WEBVTT

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:21.750
If possible, I'd like to see you again.

00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:37.220
The world my brother made is overflowing with people and all sorts of things, making it hard to breathe.

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:42.730
"Path"

00:00:51.610 --> 00:00:57.490
There are rules in this world and it feels like people are being constrained by something.

00:00:58.370 --> 00:01:02.870
People will eventually face a destiny from which they cannot escape.

00:01:03.450 --> 00:01:04.870
But that destiny...

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:10.590
is the same for me.

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:22.770
Yes?

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:25.980
Gosh, were you still sleeping?

00:01:26.390 --> 00:01:29.440
Today I made the fried chicken sandwich you love.

00:01:34.900 --> 00:01:36.780
Thank you very much.

00:01:39.660 --> 00:01:41.830
My grown up childhood friend...

00:01:43.990 --> 00:01:49.420
I intended to take care of him at aunt Maki's place, but somewhere along the way...

00:02:03.560 --> 00:02:05.020
Yakumo!

00:02:05.020 --> 00:02:06.480
I'm alright.

00:02:07.390 --> 00:02:08.980
We're done for the morning.

00:02:09.440 --> 00:02:13.730
Brother, you'll train me next time.

00:02:14.190 --> 00:02:16.570
Train me, too!

00:02:18.070 --> 00:02:19.490
Let's not.

00:02:20.910 --> 00:02:24.410
We have to attend the morning rite next, so...

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:26.620
Can't I come too?

00:02:26.620 --> 00:02:27.450
Kuro.

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:29.620
Mother!

00:02:35.050 --> 00:02:39.720
Kuro, you mustn't keep relying on Reishin.

00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:41.930
Mother?

00:02:42.850 --> 00:02:45.640
It's important to think highly of your relatives.

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:52.150
But you must think and take a righteous path of your own.

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:04.950
Was my mother aware of what my brother tried to do?

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:14.130
It smells good...

00:03:16.550 --> 00:03:18.300
Cheers!

00:03:19.010 --> 00:03:20.800
Congratulations, Lisa!

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:22.050
Thanks!

00:03:22.550 --> 00:03:26.600
Who would have thought that our quiet Lisa would marry first?

00:03:28.310 --> 00:03:31.890
What about you and that younger guy?

00:03:32.640 --> 00:03:37.320
Keita-kun? He's just a childhood friend...

00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:39.480
You're still going on about that?

00:03:39.480 --> 00:03:43.280
You need to make a more feminine approach!

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:44.740
More feminine?

00:03:44.740 --> 00:03:47.580
You have these fine weapons and all...

00:03:48.700 --> 00:03:50.500
Stop it!

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:53.500
They've grown even more, haven't they, Akane?

00:03:57.960 --> 00:03:59.800
Marriage, huh?

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:02.090
Here's your lunch.

00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:05.090
Today I made the fried chicken you love.

00:04:05.470 --> 00:04:07.600
You don't have to do this.

00:04:08.220 --> 00:04:10.270
I'll make more again.

00:04:10.270 --> 00:04:11.350
I told you, it's fine.

00:04:12.180 --> 00:04:16.100
Though he said that, he always ate every morsel.

00:04:17.610 --> 00:04:22.150
Why does it have to be Keita-kun...

00:04:30.990 --> 00:04:35.290
Sometimes, I feel my brother's Tera, but I can't find him.

00:04:38.590 --> 00:04:41.460
The person who treated me to ramen yesterday...

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:46.890
Wait, Mayu-chan!

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:53.730
A kid was run over!

00:04:53.730 --> 00:04:55.020
Somebody call an ambulance!

00:04:56.100 --> 00:04:58.360
M-Mayu-chan...

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:00.900
Poor girl...

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:05.530
She wasn't a Root.

00:05:06.150 --> 00:05:07.530
Mayu!

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:22.960
Hey, do you-

00:05:26.930 --> 00:05:29.180
We found a stray Mototsumitama! Proceeding to capture!

00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:47.450
I wasted too much energy. My stomach is growling.

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:57.460
Punipuni, what's wrong?

00:05:57.460 --> 00:05:59.670
Punipuni, you idiot!

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:04.500
Ramen, hamburger, bibimbap, shish kebab...

00:06:09.130 --> 00:06:11.600
I wonder if Keita-kun is alright...?

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:25.400
Are you alright?

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:28.150
Yes, thank you very much!

00:06:28.150 --> 00:06:29.820
Where's that person?

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:31.030
Keita-kun?

00:06:31.030 --> 00:06:34.030
He treated me to some ramen yesterday.

00:06:34.410 --> 00:06:35.700
Keita-kun?

00:06:38.910 --> 00:06:42.290
Don't tell me you fainted from hunger...

00:06:42.290 --> 00:06:44.460
Well, yes...

00:06:44.460 --> 00:06:47.590
I'll go buy something to eat.

00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:53.300
Then wait a second. Lock the door just in case.

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:54.140
Yes.

00:06:57.020 --> 00:07:00.020
Punipuni, tonight we might actually be able to eat dinner.

00:07:04.310 --> 00:07:06.150
What is it, Punipuni?

00:07:07.400 --> 00:07:09.740
There's something in this box?

00:07:25.790 --> 00:07:27.750
Who are you? What are you-

00:07:31.510 --> 00:07:33.760
Welcome home, I'll be staying around.

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:39.180
Was I not supposed to eat this cabbage?

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:43.190
I'm so sorry, I was so hungry that I couldn't help myself.

00:07:44.770 --> 00:07:46.770
Why are you here?

00:07:49.190 --> 00:07:52.030
I made him upset.

00:07:53.360 --> 00:07:54.870
Please, leave.

00:07:56.660 --> 00:08:00.290
I don't want to get involved with someone like you.

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:02.290
It was a little...

00:08:02.620 --> 00:08:06.710
No, it was very shameless of me.

00:08:19.930 --> 00:08:25.020
I can't cause any more inconvenience to such a kind person.

00:08:26.190 --> 00:08:29.320
You must take a righteous path of your own.

00:08:33.110 --> 00:08:33.950
Hey!

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:34.820
Yes?

00:08:37.570 --> 00:08:40.200
I'm very thankful.

00:08:40.200 --> 00:08:41.870
Give my regards to the lady too.

00:08:42.870 --> 00:08:45.750
This little girl beat you up?

00:08:46.830 --> 00:08:51.380
We, Tribal Ends, who have attained the power of the Shishigami...

00:08:52.420 --> 00:08:54.510
Will make you the fifth...

00:08:55.050 --> 00:08:58.050
To become a meal to my previously unseen Exceed!

00:09:01.640 --> 00:09:02.220
What's wrong?

00:09:03.020 --> 00:09:04.480
More, more!

00:09:05.440 --> 00:09:07.900
Make me numb!

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:21.240
He must be banished.

00:09:21.240 --> 00:09:23.370
And that will solve everything?

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:30.880
He brought human females and experimented carelessly with contracts over and over again.

00:09:30.880 --> 00:09:32.920
And with such atrocious ways...

00:09:36.470 --> 00:09:38.800
In that case, leave him under my supervision.

00:09:39.340 --> 00:09:40.890
But, Young Lord...

00:09:41.220 --> 00:09:43.890
I am the next chief of the Shishigami.

00:09:46.180 --> 00:09:51.820
I have heard that if a Mototsumitama performs a contract with a human, he becomes able to perform Exceed.

00:09:51.820 --> 00:09:55.070
If I can become stronger, then I want to quickly perform a contract.

00:09:56.570 --> 00:09:58.200
With the one I choose.

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:08.210
But right now, I want to save this person.

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:14.670
Keita-san, please accept this.

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:28.180
Keita-kun...

00:10:35.860 --> 00:10:37.570
It's been half a year since then...

00:10:38.190 --> 00:10:40.160
Will I ever see you again, Keita-kun?

00:10:40.780 --> 00:10:43.070
I wanted to support you...

00:10:44.120 --> 00:10:48.580
I was supposed to be the one to support Keita-kun...

00:10:50.420 --> 00:10:56.960
In the end, I only brought hardships to my precious contractee.

00:10:57.760 --> 00:10:59.970
Keita-san won't regain consciousness.

00:11:00.840 --> 00:11:02.970
And where is Akane-san?

00:11:06.850 --> 00:11:07.850
That's...

00:11:08.850 --> 00:11:11.520
not cool...

00:11:14.940 --> 00:11:16.400
Shingo...

00:11:26.370 --> 00:11:27.740
Can't sleep?

00:11:28.580 --> 00:11:31.120
Are you nervous about going to Okinawa tomorrow?

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:34.420
No, that's not it.

00:11:37.050 --> 00:11:38.210
Kuro-chan?

00:11:39.710 --> 00:11:44.680
I could tell Keita-san was a Sub from his Tera flow, but...

00:11:48.850 --> 00:11:52.270
But the prospect of dying from an exhaustive battle is just...

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:56.480
I performed the contract with the intent of saving him, but now...

00:11:58.190 --> 00:11:59.400
Kuro-chan...

00:11:59.940 --> 00:12:03.530
Keita-san is kind and won't blame me.

00:12:04.610 --> 00:12:09.660
But deep inside, he must hate and blame me.

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:12.290
That's not true.

00:12:13.540 --> 00:12:19.090
Since he was young, Keita-kun has never hated anyone, no matter what.

00:12:19.840 --> 00:12:24.180
He hides his sadness and pain all inside himself.

00:12:24.590 --> 00:12:28.050
So he doesn't hate you at all.

00:12:28.050 --> 00:12:32.430
You really know Keita-san well.

00:12:34.270 --> 00:12:36.690
Is it because you've always been together?

00:12:36.980 --> 00:12:38.770
Well, there's that, but...

00:12:39.770 --> 00:12:45.030
I guess it's also because I've always wanted to understand him.

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:51.870
This time, when Keita-san wakes up, I will definitely try to understand him better.

00:12:55.420 --> 00:13:00.250
When I see Keita-kun again, I won't ever let go of him.

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:03.920
I'll always stay by his side.

00:13:06.430 --> 00:13:08.430
I've been in a coma?

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:11.640
Yeah, for half a year.

00:13:11.640 --> 00:13:13.270
You finally woke up!

00:13:14.810 --> 00:13:16.270
Keita-san...

00:13:18.940 --> 00:13:20.440
Keita-kun!

00:13:22.730 --> 00:13:27.160
I'm so glad you're alright, Keita-kun.

00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:30.070
Akane-san...

00:13:31.990 --> 00:13:33.410
But destiny...

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:42.590
A trump card is something to be played only at the very end.

00:13:43.800 --> 00:13:46.970
Destiny brought my contractee an even greater trial.

00:13:49.300 --> 00:13:51.100
But even after overcoming that...

00:13:52.220 --> 00:13:53.810
W-What's wrong?!

00:13:54.220 --> 00:13:56.310
Sadness befell us once again.

00:14:02.820 --> 00:14:04.070
Keita-kun...

00:14:04.440 --> 00:14:07.700
I said I wouldn't let go if I saw you again...

00:14:16.410 --> 00:14:17.620
Masagami?

00:14:19.620 --> 00:14:22.880
One of them was defeated and two of them were sealed.

00:14:22.880 --> 00:14:27.300
Still, our clan casted a curse on the humans.

00:14:27.300 --> 00:14:28.760
The Masagami will be revived again.

00:14:30.050 --> 00:14:33.260
And Kuro-chan is one of the Masagami?

00:14:37.060 --> 00:14:41.100
I will wake the Masagami and defeat them before she awakens completely.

00:14:41.100 --> 00:14:43.360
But to do so, you must form a contract with me.

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:45.690
Contract?

00:14:48.990 --> 00:14:50.570
That crest...

00:14:53.830 --> 00:14:55.030
Pain.

00:14:57.290 --> 00:14:58.410
Sadness.

00:14:59.460 --> 00:15:00.870
A strong resolve.

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:06.920
And...

00:15:10.170 --> 00:15:11.260
Yuki.

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:14.720
Love.

00:15:17.220 --> 00:15:19.560
That's what a contract is.

00:15:22.100 --> 00:15:26.520
Keita-kun and Kuro-chan can feel each other's feelings.

00:15:27.110 --> 00:15:29.860
Then they'll be fine even if I'm gone.

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:33.200
Keita-kun will be fine.

00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:39.370
If Kuro-chan is no longer herself, I'm sure Keita-kun will be sad.

00:15:40.040 --> 00:15:48.340
Besides, if the Masagami who cursed the humans are gone, Keita-kun will be released from his harsh destiny.

00:15:49.340 --> 00:15:54.800
There won't be more tragedies like aunt Maki's and Yuki-san's.

00:15:57.310 --> 00:16:01.600
This time I might never see Keita-kun again, but...

00:16:03.140 --> 00:16:03.980
But...

00:16:06.480 --> 00:16:10.900
Akane-san performed a contract to save Keita-san.

00:16:12.150 --> 00:16:16.530
To release him from his harsh destiny.

00:16:26.250 --> 00:16:28.380
Exceed...

00:16:28.380 --> 00:16:30.340
Teraexe!

00:16:34.760 --> 00:16:38.930
We thought everything would end if the Masagami were defeated, but...

00:16:43.690 --> 00:16:46.060
I'll miss them...

00:16:46.060 --> 00:16:48.060
It's lively enough, right?

00:16:49.270 --> 00:16:54.240
Should I return to the Sacred Precincts, too?

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:56.530
It's fine if you stay.

00:16:57.990 --> 00:17:00.700
If you go home, you can't eat ramen anymore, right?

00:17:02.700 --> 00:17:03.710
Yes!

00:17:07.420 --> 00:17:08.880
I'm so happy!

00:17:09.790 --> 00:17:13.720
The three of us being able to spend a calm day again...

00:17:18.010 --> 00:17:18.970
What?

00:17:19.260 --> 00:17:23.810
I'm really glad I became Keita-san's contractee.

00:17:24.730 --> 00:17:27.730
Besides, my brother's contractee is Akane-san.

00:17:28.730 --> 00:17:30.150
Kuro-chan?

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:34.740
I think Keita-san will be happy if you're here.

00:17:34.740 --> 00:17:36.740
R-Really?

00:17:42.490 --> 00:17:44.250
Akane-san, are you alright?

00:17:45.080 --> 00:17:46.290
Yes.

00:17:48.170 --> 00:17:50.170
I'm sorry, Keita-kun.

00:17:50.170 --> 00:17:51.000
It's fine.

00:17:52.210 --> 00:17:57.090
If Keita-san can always be happy, then I too...

00:18:12.520 --> 00:18:13.440
Kuro...

00:18:14.530 --> 00:18:15.530
Are you...?

00:18:19.820 --> 00:18:21.070
I'm off.

00:18:23.910 --> 00:18:25.200
Take care, okay?

00:18:34.130 --> 00:18:38.590
Ibuki and the others destroyed the Doppeliner system.

00:18:39.340 --> 00:18:44.310
Kaionji Holdings has filed for restructuring in the Tokyo Court under the Company Resuscitation Law.

00:18:45.180 --> 00:18:48.350
It carries a total debt of 1,975—

00:18:48.350 --> 00:18:52.560
But there are still countless systems in this world.

00:18:55.360 --> 00:18:59.200
We will always be tested, until the day we die.

00:19:25.390 --> 00:19:27.930
Thank you, Kuro-chan.

00:19:30.140 --> 00:19:30.230
This is the first frame of the ED

00:19:37.320 --> 00:19:48.410
As it thaws my frozen body, before we realize it, dawn arrives.

00:19:37.320 --> 00:19:48.410
Itsu Shika Asa wo Mukae Itetsuku Karada Tokete

00:19:48.410 --> 00:19:59.840
I've returned from my untimely death with my awakened memories.

00:19:48.410 --> 00:19:59.840
Sameta Kioku de Hayasugita Shi wo Kaeshite

00:20:00.130 --> 00:20:12.230
The sounds of the bugs weeping, the sounds of the birds dancing in flight...

00:20:00.130 --> 00:20:12.230
Mushitachi no Naku Koe mo Toritachi no Mau Haoto ni mo

00:20:12.230 --> 00:20:28.620
This soundless, white wasteland will be overflowing with their vivid colors.

00:20:12.230 --> 00:20:28.620
Oto wo Nakushita Shiroki Kare Chi ni Afureru Iro wo Sosoide Iku Azayaka ni

00:20:41.590 --> 00:20:44.180
Princess, would you like some fruit?

00:20:46.050 --> 00:20:47.390
Princess?

00:20:49.060 --> 00:20:54.140
I haven't synchro'd ever since I was sealed here.

00:20:55.980 --> 00:20:59.150
Kuro, it's alright now.

00:20:59.150 --> 00:21:00.360
Keita-san.

00:21:02.070 --> 00:21:04.530
I will take the curse with me.

00:21:06.660 --> 00:21:09.450
I have truly had a happy life.

00:21:10.580 --> 00:21:13.580
Thank you, Kuro.

00:21:16.290 --> 00:21:17.580
Gramps!

00:21:17.120 --> 00:21:20.380
Gramps, Grandma said dinner was ready.

00:21:21.750 --> 00:21:23.090
Gramps?

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:31.390
I'm so glad. Keita has lived happily ever since.

00:21:33.100 --> 00:21:36.190
Keita-san, thank you.

00:21:37.100 --> 00:21:38.480
Rest in peace,

00:21:39.560 --> 00:21:44.270
The End

00:21:39.900 --> 00:21:41.900
my contractee.
